+| 5 HistoPyramid compaction | GPU-side; the fixed cost is already measured at ~0.22 ms | Neutral | One pyramid per dispatch | **Chosen precisely because it is deterministic** — reduction tree, no atomics | GPU-resident meshing without losing the hash gate |
+| 6 Selective exact predicates | Only on cells that trip the near-zero test — a small fraction | Neutral | Zero | Improves it — removes an epsilon | Correct behaviour on quantised and CT data |
+| 7 Bounded grid deformation | One gradient evaluation and one Newton step per grid corner | Neutral | Zero | Safe — deterministic arithmetic | Sharper CSG edges, **if it clears M-315's ceiling** |
